Wolfi deviation 1 of 2 (docs/deviations.md, "ps-entry.sh jemalloc path"): the EL9 image preloads
/usr/lib64/libjemalloc.so.1 (EPEL jemalloc). Wolfi's jemalloc package ships only
/usr/lib/libjemalloc.so.2 (no .so.1 at all); /usr/lib64 is a symlink to lib. Only used when
INIT_TOKUDB is set. Same path as LD_PRELOAD in /etc/sysconfig/mysql.

--- a/ps-entry.sh	2026-11-13 23:03:20.173083042 +0200
+++ b/ps-entry.sh	2026-11-13 23:03:20.175083040 +0200
@@ -85,7 +85,7 @@
 	_check_config "$@"
 
 	if [ -n "$INIT_TOKUDB" ]; then
-		export LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib64/libjemalloc.so.1
+		export LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib/libjemalloc.so.2
 	fi
 	# Get config
 	DATADIR="$(_get_config 'datadir' "$@")"
